<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Secondary notes</h1>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
  <p><%= status_badge(:missing) %> The secondary database is not configured.</p>
  <p>Set <code>SECONDARY_DATABASE_URL</code> to a <code>postgresql://</code> or <code>mysql2://</code> URL, and add
    <code>bin/rails db:secondary:prepare</code> to the deploy command to create its table.</p>
</div>
